.LP
2026-09-25:
.LP
.EX
Touch Bar USB configuration 1          OK
appletbdrm не загружен                 OK
F1..F12 default                        OK
hold Fn -> media/brightness            OK
release Fn -> F1..F12                  OK
xremap Apple Fn mode                   OK
ws-touchbar-fn service                 OK
